{"version":1,"content":"<p>【終於 ... 😂】大家還記得 Intel 在 2023 年推出 APX 擴充指令集嗎！</p><p>？</p><p>當時聲稱告別 20 年 x86 架構局限，但 Microsoft 一直未有說明何時跟進。</p><p>如今，Microsoft 終於在 Windows 11 預覽測試版本 Build 29695 中加入 APX 指令支援，將大幅降低記憶體存取延遲並顯著提升 64 位元應用程式的執行效能，x86 平台要重新起飛了嗎？</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:34.317309+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T04:17:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:19.351720+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:19.351720+00:00","content_hash":"89238f4bb01bd9b10f49d6080e3e0a8b94bb24d7f46c7f44a94cd76218cea3fe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}